<title>ROMANIA: ROMANIA JOBLESS RATE DOWN TO 6.8 PCT IN MAY.</title>
<headline>ROMANIA JOBLESS RATE DOWN TO 6.8 PCT IN MAY.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania's jobless rate inched down to 6.8 percent in May from seven percent the previous month, the Labour Ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>					  MAY	 APRIL	  MAY 96</p>
<p> Number of unemployed	   709,486    730,991	862,736</p>
<p> Pct of workforce		   6.8	  7.0	    7.7</p>
<p>NOTE -- Romania's workforce is 10.491 million. According to government forecasts, unemployment is expected to soar to 10.3 percent this year from 6.1 percent at end-1996 as the country restructures its communist-era industries.</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
